WEBVTT

00:00:01.556 --> 00:00:03.029
Po! Bandits!
阿宝！

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.466
Approaching
the musicians' village.
一帮土匪朝向乐师村来了!

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.293
Danger.
Tell those musicians
危险，让那些乐师加快节奏，要开仗了！

00:00:06.468 --> 00:00:07.947
to start playing
some action music,
危险，让那些乐师加快节奏，要开仗了！

00:00:08.121 --> 00:00:09.949
because it is on.
危险，让那些乐师加快节奏，要开仗了！

00:00:10.123 --> 00:00:12.256
Don't worry, Shifu,
I'll master inner peace
as soon as I get back.
别担心，等我回来了就掌握心静如止水

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.954
- No snack stops this time.
- [laughing]
路上别买点心吃

00:00:15.128 --> 00:00:17.000
Snack stops.
[blows raspberry]
别买点心

00:00:17.174 --> 00:00:18.828
Wait, are you serious?
等等，你没开玩笑吧？

00:00:20.438 --> 00:00:21.918
[bell gongs]

00:00:22.092 --> 00:00:23.398
[shouting]

00:00:26.444 --> 00:00:29.099
- [yelling]
- [growling]

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:34.104
Get all the metal
you can find!
能找到多少铁都要!

00:00:37.542 --> 00:00:39.457
Grab the metal!
快找铁！

00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:41.633
[shouting]

00:00:42.982 --> 00:00:45.985
- [sobbing]
- Help, help, help, help!
救命啊！救命啊！

00:00:48.292 --> 00:00:49.902
[shrieks]
只有这些！我们走！

00:00:50.076 --> 00:00:51.991
That's everything!
Let's get out of here.
只有这些！我们走！

00:00:52.165 --> 00:00:53.210
OK.

00:00:53.384 --> 00:00:54.646
- Oh, no.
- [grunts]

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.605
[high-pitched cry]

00:00:59.869 --> 00:01:02.828
Wings of Justice!
[yelling]
正义的翅膀！

00:01:03.742 --> 00:01:06.136
[screaming]

00:01:07.659 --> 00:01:08.921
Po!

00:01:09.487 --> 00:01:11.663
Yee-hah!

00:01:16.233 --> 00:01:18.104
- [all] Hah!
- Hmm?

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:19.628
Ha-ha!

00:01:19.802 --> 00:01:21.978
- [cheering]
- The Dragon Warrior!
龙战士！

00:01:22.152 --> 00:01:24.371
The panda?
That's impossible.
一只熊猫？不可能

00:01:24.546 --> 00:01:26.330
My fist hungers for justice.
我的拳头痒痒，想伸张正义

00:01:26.504 --> 00:01:27.679
[grumbling]
我的拳头痒痒，想伸张正义

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:29.376
- That was my... fist.
- [groans]
那是我的…拳头

00:01:29.551 --> 00:01:30.943
Get 'em!
抓住他们！

00:01:31.117 --> 00:01:33.076
- Come on!
- Yeah!
上！

00:01:36.688 --> 00:01:38.342
[all] Ooh!

00:01:39.604 --> 00:01:41.214
- [clanging]
- [all] Yay!

00:01:44.348 --> 00:01:45.523
[groans]

00:01:45.697 --> 00:01:48.091
[plays stringed instrument]

00:01:55.185 --> 00:01:56.491
Take that!
看招！

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:05.500
[clattering]

00:02:07.023 --> 00:02:08.415
Po! Incoming!
阿宝！有敌情！

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:09.939
Thanks, Mantis!
谢谢，大刀螳！

00:02:10.113 --> 00:02:11.157
[growling]

00:02:12.463 --> 00:02:13.420
[groans]

00:02:13.595 --> 00:02:15.510
[plays stringed instrument]

00:02:17.903 --> 00:02:18.861
[yelps]

00:02:21.951 --> 00:02:23.474
[growling]

00:02:27.522 --> 00:02:28.740
[growling and snarling]

00:02:28.914 --> 00:02:30.873
Tigress, Double Death Strike!
娇虎！双亡出击！

00:02:38.054 --> 00:02:39.359
[Po] Ye-aargh!

00:02:39.534 --> 00:02:42.101
- Feet of Fury!
- Aaargh!
愤怒的大脚

00:02:42.275 --> 00:02:45.017
[all cry out]

00:02:45.191 --> 00:02:46.279
Tigress!
娇虎！

00:02:46.453 --> 00:02:47.411
Monkey!
金猴！灵蛇！

00:02:47.585 --> 00:02:49.587
Viper! Mantis!
大刀螳！

00:02:49.761 --> 00:02:52.285
- Bunny! What?
- [continues playing]
兔子！啥意思？

00:02:52.459 --> 00:02:53.548
Oh, sorry.
对不起

00:02:54.766 --> 00:02:56.725
[howls]

00:02:59.554 --> 00:03:01.381
[screams] Help!
救命！

00:03:01.556 --> 00:03:03.688
- Crane, go!
- I'm on it!
仙鹤，上！ 我来也！

00:03:06.517 --> 00:03:07.866
Ahh!

00:03:09.259 --> 00:03:10.260
Hoo!

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.741
Whoa!

00:03:16.266 --> 00:03:18.311
[straining]

00:03:22.881 --> 00:03:24.796
Is everyone OK?
大家都没事吧？

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.929
- [cheering]
- Awesome!
真厉害！

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:30.802
I got this.
我能对付

00:03:37.243 --> 00:03:39.506
[crying]

00:03:41.944 --> 00:03:42.901
Po!
阿宝！

00:03:45.121 --> 00:03:46.078
Oof!

00:03:47.689 --> 00:03:48.777
[all cry out]

00:03:49.691 --> 00:03:51.127
Chew on that, tubby!
肥肥，慢慢享用吧！

00:03:51.301 --> 00:03:52.824
Ha-ha, ha-ha-ha!

00:03:54.609 --> 00:03:56.306
Ha-ha, ha-ha-ha!

00:03:58.525 --> 00:04:00.963
[grunts and groans]
小乖乖，你没事吧？ 出了啥事？

00:04:01.137 --> 00:04:03.139
- Are you OK?
- What happened?
小乖乖，你没事吧？ 出了啥事？

00:04:04.793 --> 00:04:06.490
I think I saw...
我好像看见…

00:04:06.664 --> 00:04:09.841
I think... I gotta go.
我似乎…

00:04:12.583 --> 00:04:14.324
Thank you.
Thank you for coming
谢谢，多谢光临龙战士豆腐面馆

00:04:14.498 --> 00:04:18.197
to Dragon Warrior Noodles
and Tofu.
谢谢，多谢光临龙战士豆腐面馆

00:04:18.371 --> 00:04:20.112
- More tea? Lemon sauce?
- No.
添茶？柠檬酱？要啥尽管说

00:04:20.286 --> 00:04:22.941
If you need anything,
just ask.
添茶？柠檬酱？要啥尽管说

00:04:23.899 --> 00:04:26.205
- Thank you.
- Feet of Fury!
谢谢

00:04:26.379 --> 00:04:29.469
Ah, the Dragon Warrior's mop.
龙战士的拖把，他就用它拖这里的地板！

00:04:29.644 --> 00:04:31.210
He mopped these very floors!
龙战士的拖把，他就用它拖这里的地板！

00:04:31.384 --> 00:04:34.605
Uh, uh... No touching!
You'll get the mop dirty.
别碰！小心弄脏了拖把

00:04:35.693 --> 00:04:37.564
- He once waited on me.
- Awesome!
有一次他来招待我的 有两下子！

00:04:37.739 --> 00:04:39.175
Yeah,
I have the stain to prove it.
我有污渍为证，龙战士呢？

00:04:39.349 --> 00:04:41.438
Hey, where is
the Dragon Warrior?
我有污渍为证，龙战士呢？

00:04:41.612 --> 00:04:44.223
He doesn't work here anymore.
他不在这儿上班了

